here are other properties which needs to be configurable at runtime.\r\nAlso the confluent schema registry need to be configurable (again with auth properties)\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nMore properties needs to be configurable @ runtime\r\n\r\nFor me now at least; could be more:\r\nkafka-streams.schema.registry.url\r\nkafka-streams.sasl.jaas.config\r\nkafka-streams.ssl.truststore.location\r\nkafka-streams.ssl.truststore.password\r\nkafka-streams.ssl.keystore.location\r\nkafka-streams.ssl.keystore.password\r\nkafka-streams.ssl.key.password\r\n\r\n**Actual behavior**\r\nProperties cannot be overriden @ runtime.\r\n\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\nSteps to reproduce the behavior:\r\n\r\nTry to change them @ runtime does not work.\r\n\r\n\r\n**Solution proposal**\r\nAs there could be other properties which might need to be added could there be an option which let the user define which properties he/she whants configurable @ runtime?\r\nPrefix the runtime config with quarkus.kafka-streams and the build time config just with kafka-streams.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"gsmet","id":1279749,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk3NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1279749?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet","html_url":"https://github.com/gsmet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"ur